# Phase 01 — Foundation

## Goal

Bootstrap a runnable Expo + TypeScript strict app with Expo Router, auth-gated route groups, bottom-tab shell, tooling, and project docs.

## Tasks

- Initialize Expo (Expo Router) with TypeScript strict.
- Auth-gated route groups (e.g. signed-in vs signed-out).
- Bottom-tab shell with placeholder screens: Dashboard, Members, Attendance, Payments, Settings.
- ESLint, Prettier, Jest + React Native Testing Library.
- Env config (`.env` / `.env.example`); no secrets in Git.
- Supabase CLI wired for local/dev workflow.
- Create/update `BUILD_STATUS.md` and `SETUP.md`.

## Done when

- [ ] Lint passes
- [ ] Typecheck passes
- [ ] Tests pass
- [ ] App starts successfully
- [ ] `BUILD_STATUS.md` and `SETUP.md` exist and reflect Phase 1

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
